WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:27.081
Mrs. Tiggywinkle knocked on the bunnies' door.

2
00:00:27.082 --> 00:00:35.932
"I've got your clean clothes!" she called.

3
00:00:35.933 --> 00:00:39.612
Mrs. Rabbit opened the door.

4
00:00:39.613 --> 00:00:45.714
"Thank you, Mrs. Tiggywinkle," she said.

5
00:00:45.715 --> 00:00:54.921
Mrs. Tiggywinkle saw three busy bunnies.

6
00:00:54.922 --> 00:01:05.544
"You are learning to sew!" Mrs. Tiggywinkle said.

7
00:01:05.545 --> 00:01:08.297
"What a nice job!"

8
00:01:08.298 --> 00:01:12.194
"We are making curtains," Flopsy said.

9
00:01:12.195 --> 00:01:17.275
"Sewing is fun!" Cotton-tail said.

10
00:01:17.276 --> 00:01:21.899
"My cousin is a tailor," Mrs. Tiggywinkle said.

11
00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:25.999
"I wish he could see your fine work."

12
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.932
Mrs. Tiggywinkle said good-bye to the bunnies.

13
00:01:30.933 --> 00:01:52.975
She brought clean clothes to more animals.

14
00:01:52.976 --> 00:01:59.983
Then she went to visit her cousin.

15
00:01:59.984 --> 00:02:03.220
The tailor was sewing.

16
00:02:03.221 --> 00:02:07.690
But he looked terrible.

17
00:02:07.691 --> 00:02:16.137
Mrs. Tiggywinkle gasped.

18
00:02:16.138 --> 00:02:18.417
"Cousin, you are sick.

19
00:02:18.418 --> 00:02:21.191
You must go to bed at once!"

20
00:02:21.192 --> 00:02:23.754
The tailor hung his head.

21
00:02:23.755 --> 00:02:27.324
"I can't go to bed," he said.

22
00:02:27.325 --> 00:02:30.263
"I must finish this coat."

23
00:02:30.264 --> 00:02:33.991
The tailor held up a fancy coat.

24
00:02:33.992 --> 00:02:37.730
"It's for the mayor," he said.

25
00:02:37.731 --> 00:02:42.875
"And he needs it tonight!"
